":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-05T15:25:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100054.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The new implementation is about 5.5x as fast. \r\nThis optimization is appropriate because `simplify_path` is called quite a lot, especially when starting the engine (~100 times when starting the launcher, another ~1000 times when opening a project). With `1000000` iterations from the benchmark taking 200ms, 1000 iterations were taking about 1ms (down to .2ms now). It's not much, but it's something!\r\n\r\n![newplot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34129b9a-1f4b-49d8-bd32-4cf48c6d0243)\r\n\r\nThe new code is more opaque than the previous code. The reason is that most of the time was spent allocating new strings through the utility functions (`replace`, `delete_at` etc.). The fastest way to resolve the path is to resolve it manually.\r\n\r\nFortunately, it's not super hard to do it:\r\n\r\n- Handle drive part separately (verbatim, as before)\r\n- Run through each part ended by `'/'`, append to the string.\r\n- Ignore `/` at the start of path parts.\r\n- Ignore path parts that are equal to `.`.\r\n- Path parts that are equal to `..` are either resolved (by throwing away the latest path part), or prepended as a path part in a way that cannot be thrown away by subsequent `..`.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100054/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100054/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}